flowchart TB
    C[UK Carbon Intensity API] --> P[Python ingestion + backfill]
    W[Open-Meteo ERA5 historical API] --> P
    GA[GitHub Actions scheduler] --> P
    P --> GCS[Google Cloud Storage raw JSON archives]
    P --> RAW[(BigQuery energy_raw: 3 tables)]
    RAW --> STG[dbt staging: 3 views]
    STG --> INT[dbt intermediate: 3 views]
    INT --> MART[(BigQuery energy_marts: 2 tables)]
    MART --> TEST[16 dbt data tests]
    MART --> LS[Looker Studio: 3 pages]
    GA -. OIDC .-> WI[Workload Identity Federation]
    WI -. impersonates .-> SA[Dedicated service account]
